<body>
<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; line-height: 18.2857px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Hi&nbsp;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12.8px; line-height: 18.2857px;">{!Contact.FirstName},</span></div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">I wanted to send you this list about why California investors love Memphis Invest. After reading through this list, click the appointment link below to set up a time to speak with me!</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">1. Your investment dollars go MUCH further.</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
<ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
	<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-left: 15px;">You can acquire 5-10 properties for the average cost of the typical California 3/2,1,500 sqft property at $500,000.</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">2. With Memphis Invest, you can build a portfolio of income producing properties that is diversified between 3 of the best real estate investment markets in the US</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">3. Far higher ROI &amp; cash flow potential compared to California properties.</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">4. No state income taxes in TN &amp; TX.</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">5. Very friendly landlord laws in TN &amp; TX.</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">6. We come to you! It is rare that our clients want to leave sunny California to visit us in our markets, so we hold annual invitation only events in CA so that our clients get a chance to meet the team that our clients have chosen to trust with their portfolios.</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">7. Proof of Concept: We have 400+ California clients who are already enjoying investment success with our company.&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">8. The peace of mind that comes with working with one of the top performing property management companies on the planet. On our 3500+ property portfolio that we manage for investors, our average property has yielded less than 4% maintenance and less than 4% vacancy the last 4 years running. Our average tenant stay is between 3-4 years!</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">9. Our investors appreciate having the ability to invest in 3 tremendous real estate markets without fear of investing in a bubble.</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">10. All of the tax incentives that come with real estate are magnified when you own a portfolio with a higher number of properties.</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">11. Since California leads the nation in the number of self-employed entrepreneurs, obtaining financing can be challenging. Memphis Invest has financing partners that offer both conventional and creative financing to assist California real estate investors leverage their investment properties even if you do not have a &ldquo;normal job.&rdquo;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12.8px;">Thanks for reading!&nbsp;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; color: rgb(255, 0, 255);"><a href="https://www.timetrade.com/book/N2BRQ" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: none; background-color: transparent;" target="_blank">Click Here</a></span>&nbsp;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12.8px;">to set up a time to talk. I am looking forward to speaking with you.</span></div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Best regards,</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</div>

